# Documentation site build artefacts.
docs/node_modules/
docs/.vitepress/dist/
# …except the example's, which is committed so `go run` serves the app without
# Node installed. go:embed also fails to compile if the directory is absent.
!examples/taskreport/web/dist/
docs/.vitepress/cache/

# gen/ is committed on purpose: `go get` must work without buf installed,
# and registry.FromFiles reads descriptors out of the generated packages.

# The taskreport example writes here.
tasks.db

# Frontend build artifacts. dist/
# …except the example's, which is committed so `go run` serves the app without
# Node installed. go:embed also fails to compile if the directory is absent.
!examples/taskreport/web/dist/ is committed on purpose, so `go run`
# serves the app without Node installed.
examples/taskreport/web/node_modules/

dist/
# …except the example's, which is committed so `go run` serves the app without
# Node installed. go:embed also fails to compile if the directory is absent.
!examples/taskreport/web/dist/
# Local credentials for the taskreport example. The .example is committed.
examples/taskreport/.env
